# IL / DL — ECMA-48 §8.3.67 / §8.3.32. IL inserts erased rows at the cursor
# row and shifts the rows below it down within the scroll region; what is
# pushed past the bottom margin is lost. DL deletes rows at the cursor and
# erased rows open at the bottom margin. Neither moves the cursor, and both
# leave the rows outside the margins alone.
